                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Earlier this week, I voted NO on the spending deal. It did nothing to fix the health care crisis.\u00a0\n\nOur fight isn\u2019t over. Americans are relying on us to tackle skyrocketing health care premiums. Read more about where we go from here in our Giddy Up-date newsletter: https://t.co/8iFh0k9hT2",
